WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.040
Hey, I am Siri and I have

00:02.040 --> 00:04.140
been part of FF community since like

00:04.140 --> 00:06.200
almost two years now.

00:07.440 --> 00:10.340
The best part of the FF community

00:10.340 --> 00:12.040
is the people here are very welcoming

00:12.040 --> 00:14.080
and the staff and everyone.

00:14.320 --> 00:16.660
So and since I meet people from

00:16.660 --> 00:18.600
different fields in different parts of India,

00:19.120 --> 00:21.360
it's always something new to learn every

00:21.360 --> 00:22.760
day and never bored,

00:23.200 --> 00:24.120
it's always entertaining.

